2. Your visual and auditory pheromone analogy

There’s a genuine biological relationship here.

Pheromones are specifically chemical signals. But attraction, attention, threat detection, bonding, and other responses can be influenced by information received through several senses.

Research on human attractiveness documents interactions between visual appearance, voice, and smell. PubMed +1

